    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "i would love if mini.nvim could integrate easily with some lsp for neovim,\r\n\r\nNeovim LSP and DAP\r\ncoc.nvim\r\nand Treesitter\r\n\r\nsome references :\r\nhttps://github.com/catppuccin/nvim/blob/cb80c9125e3d17a83549e0179a30d1f72b9e6315/lua/catppuccin/groups/integrations/treesitter.lua\r\nhttps://github.com/catppuccin/nvim/blob/cb80c9125e3d17a83549e0179a30d1f72b9e6315/lua/catppuccin/groups/integrations/native_lsp.lua\r\nhttps://github.com/catppuccin/nvim/blob/cb80c9125e3d17a83549e0179a30d1f72b9e6315/lua/catppuccin/groups/integrations/coc_nvim.lua\r\n\r\n\r\n_Originally posted by @mohamad-supangat in https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/discussions/36#discussioncomment-3345454_",
