    "comment_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for this!\r\n\r\nPer source:\r\n- Treesitter *is* supported implicitly because all `TS*` highlight groups by default come linked to builtin ones. Which seem to work fine. At least I haven't noticed anything that catches my eye. If you think about some specific highlight group, let my know.\r\n- 'mini.base16' [has support](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/a60055a492296aa1fa5838ff5fdd2b85df96acdd/lua/mini/base16.lua#L490-L531) for built-in diagnostics, which is almost all highlight groups in that link. I'll at the rest.\r\n- 'coc.nvim' is a good candidate for being supported. Thanks!",
